aA5A6mC5_GbALCO47G9f7i3yqvnCgJOncmSZ94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMHsz0Qma5xGgPKgcmvLPbDN48c-KaO99o7iTShwqI29g&oe=6ADCBC72"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "296114026862324", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_296114030195657_275861733805151497_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMJ4kmH3Lw8Q7kNvwGw88aA&_nc_oc=AdrdVt5VE5Jof3ltLV-yT7js6dDzXDuakr8AA6TquDBSJLzCBROnGaUD861uR52l7Ig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPF0zoDAa6duvhdvpmoOSG-YDX82r6Cj0wWPga3ZOIctw&oe=6ADCC7A1"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "802537541948419", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210889_802537548615085_7583608226087987807_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7WvQab6elUoQ7kNvwHgBTbZ&_nc_oc=AdqemMes3fajVBJeT8QyJsJtHj6iPaHSYI1RbFitkPEJ8HQuAz7B66iFugIxs0je2R0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPA54y337sPqk7r-ZdoYpI40w3iy6JWQ5W7qjeuPCloJQ&oe=6ADCBD6E"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "1952004381931095", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75298472_1952004385264428_8213665801664121384_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bw3vyUd4OFAQ7kNvwEyv-bG&_nc_oc=Ado0aoQetmXg3nAy0Pn7B4k32hU6_MaFIeKgeSf19yMWqZwGEmUu-EAf6BBm3Ab1tAw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPB5xd5cFPOp-3L4rK1nKv-atmxI79pjl7tP58zfgujpA&oe=6ADCA32C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "7841830009239208", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035410_7841830012572541_6800934679758716826_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K6agzBboYU4Q7kNvwGByzzU&_nc_oc=AdoXks6BHxFObZJisjFFKj09pSaerlrEElFdewtc9uWtq9GB61IvpiRoHiRgN0TfUCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM7ircBkbe5_UmVBmrGXFkVkoLn6qAqswSMy9HC_eBWNA&oe=6ADCCF93"}, "display_name": "Orb Conquest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges.\nGameplay Overview\n\nIn \"Orb Conquest,\" players are transported to a visually stunning, high-tech environment filled with neon-lit paths and mesmerizing graphics. The game mechanics are designed to test and enhance your coordination and problem-solving skills. Each level presents a unique maze-like track, teeming with hurdles that require quick thinking and precise movements to overcome.\nKey Features\n\n    Dynamic Spheres: Master the control of highly responsive spheres, each with unique attributes and abilities that you can unlock and upgrade as you progress.\n\n    Intricate Tracks: Navigate through a variety of complex and beautifully designed tracks. Each track offers different challenges, from narrow passages to moving barriers and beyond.", "short_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SGag2426 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_categ